  "name": "sacct_poll",
  "notes": "input.stdout is what `sacct -j <ids> -n -X -P -o JobID,State,ElapsedRaw,AllocTRES` printed; input.job_ids the ids asked for; input.billing_per_su the profile's. Output {command: the remote command string, result: {job_id: [state, elapsed_s, billed_su or null]}} (tuples as lists). Lines with < 3 fields or an id not asked for are skipped; a non-digit ElapsedRaw is 0; SU only for terminal states. Profile: real DeltaAI.",
